WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Connecting rod
What it does: Together with the crankshaft, converts straight piston travel into rotation and transmits loads.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Connecting rod
How it works: The rod transfers force to the offset crankpin.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Connecting rod
How it moves: Swings sideways while the big end follows an orbit; the small end follows the piston.
